<title>UK: BOE allots 100 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 100 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 100 million stg of assistance, bringing total liquidity provided to 850 million stg, in line with the 1430 BST revised forecast..</p>
<p>It allotted 31 million stg in bills outright and 69 million stg in 6.25 percent repos to June 20.</p>
